  "question": {
    "text": "Standard electrode potentials for a few half cells are mentioned below :\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+} / \\mathrm{Cu}}^{\\circ}=0.34 \\mathrm{~V}, \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+} / \\mathrm{Zn}}^{\\circ}=-0.76 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\\n& \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Ag}^{+} / \\mathrm{Ag}}^{\\circ}=0.80 \\mathrm{~V}, \\mathrm{E}_{\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+} / \\mathrm{Mg}}^{\\circ}=-2.37 \\mathrm{~V}\n\\end{aligned}$\nWhich one of the following cells gives the most negative value of $\\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}$ ?"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Zn}\\left|\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right|\\left|\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right| \\mathrm{Ag}$",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Zn}\\left|\\mathrm{Zn}^{2+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right|\\left|\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right| \\mathrm{Mg}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Ag}\\left|\\mathrm{Ag}^{+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right|\\left|\\mathrm{Mg}^{2+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right| \\mathrm{Mg}$",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "$\\mathrm{Cu}\\left|\\mathrm{Cu}^{2+}(1 \\mathrm{M}) \\| \\mathrm{Ag}^{+}(1 \\mathrm{M})\\right| \\mathrm{Ag}$",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "$\\begin{gathered}\\because \\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}=-\\mathrm{nFE}^{\\circ} \\\\ \\text { Option }(1) \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=0.8+0.76 \\\\ =1.56 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\therefore \\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}=-2 \\times \\mathrm{F} \\times 1.56 \\\\ =-3.12 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\text { Option (2) } \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=-2.37+0.76 \\\\ =-1.61 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\therefore \\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}=-2 \\times \\mathrm{F} \\times(-1.61) \\\\ =+3.22 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\text { Option (3) } \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=-2.37-0.8 \\\\ =-3.17 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\left.\\begin{array}{c}\\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}=-2\\end{array}\\right) \\times \\mathrm{F} \\times(-3.17) \\\\ =+6.34 \\\\ \\text { Option }(4) \\mathrm{E}^{\\circ}=0.8-0.34 \\\\ =0.46 \\mathrm{~V} \\\\ \\Delta \\mathrm{G}^{\\circ}=-2 \\times \\mathrm{F} \\times 0.46 \\\\ =-0.92 \\mathrm{~V}\\end{gathered}$"
